// Ossie b03: the two departments with the largest payroll, as a block with sort and limit; the main query keeps the employees of those departments.
WITH top AS (FIND emp x FETCH x.deptno d, agg(x.sum_sal) s DESC LIMIT 2)
FIND emp e
FILTER e.deptno IN (FIND top t FETCH t.d)
FETCH e.job ASC, agg(e.sum_sal) sumsal
